{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a7209aa9dc5a833d9cde","chatId":"d99a79b2f4dc4826b735fa62327541c8","sessionId":null,"userId":99518,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"D\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"D\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1283,"promptTokens":422,"completionTokens":97,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:46:40"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00521892890289761,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a7209aa9dc5a833d9cdd","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794484000038,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:46:40","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a7209aa9dc5a833d9cdd","chatId":"d99a79b2f4dc4826b735fa62327541c8","sessionId":null,"userId":99518,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n在去日本的旅行过程中，小洁去了一家好评很多的寿司餐厅。她给自己点了很多菜，吃到很饱。她要了发票并且给了慷慨地一笔20美元的小费。但服务员看到小费后把它还给了小洁\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，服务员最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 钦佩\nB) 嫉妒\nC) 伤感\nD) 尴尬\nE) 反对\nF) 生气\n\n## 问题 2\n服务员为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 在日本文化中，收小费可能被认为是粗鲁或不尊重\nB) 她不喜欢杰西卡点的食物\nC) 她认为杰西卡是一个粗鲁的客人\nD) 她不喜欢大额的小费金额","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00521892890289761,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a7209aa9dc5a833d9cde","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794484000036,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:46:40","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"8eece7ed9bd64e319d98adcadb6d40e9"}